Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Extract useGauge and gaugeReading from Gauge

The conversion, formatting, fill and alert logic moves unchanged into
gaugeReading(), a pure function in src/hooks/useGauge.ts, and useGauge()
adds the unit state on top. Gauge keeps its props, markup and colors and
calls the hook. The spec tests now pass, and so do the characterization
and original tests, unchanged.
